### 1. Understanding the Status Conference
*   **What is the primary goal of this status conference?** (Status conferences are often administrative to check on the progress of the case, but it's important to know if the judge will make any temporary orders).
*   **Will I be expected to speak, or will you handle all the communication with the judge?**
*   **Are there any mandatory mediation or settlement discussions we need to complete before this conference?**

